<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Hi&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">More powerful than any words I could ever put into writing, I wanted to share these videos with you- some recorded by our owners talking about our company's culture and investment philosophies, and also some from our clients, talking about their experience working with us.</font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">First,&nbsp;<font color="#1155cc"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d5P7wDuBswQ&amp;index=6&amp;list=PLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_&amp;t=192s">start right here and hear the Memphis Invest story</a></span></font><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d5P7wDuBswQ&amp;index=6&amp;list=PLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_&amp;t=192s" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3Dd5P7wDuBswQ%26index%3D6%26list%3DPLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_%26t%3D192s&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1507213335411000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGD-8Z-qMoAmvSAEpsghnkEfVjF0w" style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration-line: none;">&nbsp;</a>told by the Clothier family, owners of Memphis Invest.</font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">These next few videos answer some of our most frequently asked questions overall:</font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V8lu1aeirHY&amp;index=7&amp;list=PLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DV8lu1aeirHY%26index%3D7%26list%3DPLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1507213335411000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFl_Y7SQdnpWiYnZlplDWx2JJEyxw" style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration-line: none;"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">How do I get started?</font></a></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SXfMethkcyE&amp;t=48s" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DSXfMethkcyE%26t%3D48s&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1507213335411000&amp;usg=AFQjCNESnDgoad3j8SSil3hqOkpbXMRoYw" style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration-line: none;"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Why do I need to build a portfolio vs. just buying 1 property?</font></a></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vKHIEJcNB_0&amp;t=34s" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DvKHIEJcNB_0%26t%3D34s&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1507213335411000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHYbdMR7etDHlHbxvjGsWMFjGBnnA" style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration-line: none;"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Why did you choose Memphis, Dallas, Houston, Little Rock, and Oklahoma City as your markets?</font></a></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XCOjFpDkBk0&amp;t=331s" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DXCOjFpDkBk0%26t%3D331s&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1507213335412000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHFeQi76ledkrUEchSe8bHZ92VMVw" style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration-line: none;"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">What should I be looking for when selecting the right turnkey partner?</font></a></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Ok, so you've heard from the owners, but you also REALLY need to hear it from investors that have been with us for several years.</font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">So start right&nbsp;<font color="#1155cc"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KVIFV5Ob7BQ&amp;t=28s">here</a></span></font>&nbsp;and then keep going&nbsp;<font color="#1155cc"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iDXFJs29D_o&amp;t=85s">right here</a></span></font>, and if you still need convincing that we are the best in our industry, go ahead and watch&nbsp;<font color="#1155cc"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ol9-pxqJBGc">this one</a></span></font>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<font color="#1155cc"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OgcFDsRjJz0">that one</a></span></font><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OgcFDsRjJz0" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DOgcFDsRjJz0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1507213335412000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHFUkSwvjdTwnnLqGPzk6l1SxQdjw" style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration-line: none;">.</a></font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">This next link is the most important of all. This one puts you on the path. If you feel fairly certain that we are the right fit for you as a company and that you would be a great client for us,&nbsp;<font color="#1155cc"><span style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/n2brq/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bdc5-baba97f6-16a5bdbe-baba97f6-00000002-7ji1ic9meo2cgt1q55k67ciqnlafdib7&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1">click right here to schedule a call with me and let's get this thing going!</a></span></font></font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Looking forward to talking with you soon.</font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></font></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000" style="box-sizing: border-box;" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="font-size: small; font-family: arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></div><span style="font-size: small; font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">--&nbsp;</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div class="m_-1875768429203616269gmail_signature" style="font-size: small; font-family: arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="box-sizing: border-box;"><div dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="box-sizing: border-box;"><div dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="box-sizing: border-box;"><div dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="box-sizing: border-box;"><div dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="box-sizing: border-box;"><div dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 153); border-collapse: separate;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: separate;"><table border="0" style="box-sizing: border-box; border-spacing: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; background-color: transparent;"><tbody style="box-sizing: border-box;"><tr style="box-sizing: border-box;"><td width="200px" style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;"><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-size: large; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Allen Nason</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></p><i style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: large;"><font color="#000000" face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif" style="box-sizing: border-box;">Portfolio Advisor&nbsp;</font><br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></i><div style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;"><font color="#666666" styl